menuconfig MODULES_SUN_TRACKER
	bool "sun_tracker"
	default n
	depends on MODULES_WING_TILT
	---help---
		Enable the sun-tracking tilt-wing controller. Points a tilt-actuated solar surface at
		the sun using GPS position, UTC time and vehicle attitude, publishing wing-angle
		setpoints to the wing_tilt controller (which owns the encoder loop and the tilt ESC).
